  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Minor triad sounds compared to major:\n\n- A) Darker/more melancholic\n- B) Identical\n- C) Always dissonant\n- D) Only percussion\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Dominant 7th chord creates tension wanting resolution.\n\n**Answer:** True\n\n### Q3. Chord inversions share quality but differ in bass note.\n\n**Answer:** True",
